1373:  *
1374:  * fflags:
1375:  * - NOTE_WL_THREAD_REQUEST is set if there is a thread request knote
1376:  * - NOTE_WL_SYNC_WAIT is set if there is at least one waiter
1377:  *
1378:  * ext[0]: 64bit thread ID of the owner if any
1379:  * ext[1]: 64bit thread ID of the servicer if any
1380:  * ext[2]: number of workloops owned by the caller thread
